---
description: AegisSec ethical cybersecurity rules
alwaysApply: true
---
Read AGENTS.md first. Apply policy/policy-precedence.md. Active real-world testing requires explicit engagement scope. Consequential actions use DISCOVER → PLAN → APPROVE → EXECUTE → VERIFY → CLOSE. Prefer defensive and reversible work, preserve evidence, minimise sensitive data and require human approval for high-impact changes.
